---
title: Convoak System Overview
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph Client["Browser"]
        UI[React SPA]
        WS[WebSocket Client]
    end

    subgraph Supabase["Supabase Platform"]
        Auth[Auth Service]
        API[PostgREST API]
        Realtime[Realtime Server]
        
        subgraph Database["PostgreSQL"]
            Tables[(Tables)]
            RLS[Row Level Security]
            Functions[Functions & Triggers]
        end
    end

    subgraph External["External Services"]
        Resend[Resend Email]
        Google[Google OAuth]
        Microsoft[Microsoft OAuth]
    end

    UI -->|REST| API
    UI -->|Auth| Auth
    WS <-->|Subscribe| Realtime
    
    API --> RLS
    RLS --> Tables
    Tables --> Functions
    Functions --> Realtime
    
    Auth -->|OTP Email| Resend
    Auth <-->|OAuth| Google
    Auth <-->|OAuth| Microsoft

    classDef client fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7
    classDef supabase fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#059669
    classDef db fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef external fill:#f3e8ff,stroke:#9333ea
    
    class UI,WS client
    class Auth,API,Realtime supabase
    class Tables,RLS,Functions db
    class Resend,Google,Microsoft external
